<title>JAPAN: Sony Precision - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sony Precision - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.16		vs	    5.38</p>
<p> Operating	  449 mln	     vs	   87 mln</p>
<p> Current	    534 mln	     vs	  269 mln</p>
<p> Net		  528 mln	     vs	  263 mln</p>
<p> EPS		   27.08 yen	  vs	   13.49 yen</p>
<p> Shares		20 mln	     vs	   20 mln</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sony Precision Technology Inc is a leading maker of &quot;magnescales&quot; for machine tools.</p>
</text>
